        "Description": "Hello 47, \r\rour investigation into Claudio Parisi has uncovered another connection. Földesi Bartalan, a close friend of Parisi, has been hiding in Marrakesh under the protection of a local criminal organization. The protection is overseen by Yazeed Nuhbaz, Koch’s right hand, while Clemens Koch controls the entire operation. All three have played a role in keeping Parisi’s secrets buried. Your objective is simple: eliminate them.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
